    # Data product / Snapshot
    title: "DAC1: Flows by provider (ODA+OOF+Private)"
    description: |-
      This dataset provides main aggregates of DAC members' and other provider countries' official development assistance (ODA) flows and grant equivalents, as well as other resource flows to developing countries.
    # NOTE: From the dataflow's "Actual" content constraint (validFrom, dataflow version 1.8), which matches the Data
    # Explorer page's "Last updated" stamp.
    date_published: "2026-10-08"

    # Citation
    producer: "OECD"
    citation_full: |-
      OECD (2026). DAC1: Flows by provider (ODA+OOF+Private). OECD Data Explorer.

    # Files
